      "role": "user",
      "content": "i dont even know why im wasting my time typing this out anymore. i just spent 6 hours on hold only to be told my housing appeal was denied because of a \"clerical error\" that i can't even fix because the person who made the error isnt even in the system anymore. it’s like i don't even exist to them. i’m just a file that keeps getting lost or deleted. it feels like the world is just moving on without me and i'm just stuck in this loop of nothingness.",
